<title>USA: Marriott unit joins Pegasus HCC system.</title>
<headline>Marriott unit joins Pegasus HCC system.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marriott International Inc's Marriot Lodging division said Monday it joined Pegasus Systems Inc's consolidated travel agent commission, payment and reconciliation service.</p>
<p>The service, called Hotel Clearing Corp or HCC, has more than 60,000 travel agent subscribers in 147 countries. Marriott's participation will be effective in the third quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Pegasus is based in Dallas.</p>
